-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T19:57:46-07:00","id":1299497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1297533-concept-heterodoxical-styles-featuring-cloud-mastery-style-and-golden-bells-style?p=1299224#post1299224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah, just got distracted by other ideas I'm tinkering with <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> My impulse is for Fire Dragon to become Holy Fire (because duh), Water Dragon becomes Waves Like Water, and Wood Dragon becomes Wisdom of the Seven Gates - but I hadn't gotten further than that or what charm's they'd replace or etcetc.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Waves Like Water to Water Dragon seems a difficult crossover, given that the former relies on snaking motions of long, flexible weapons and Water Dragon uses razors strapped onto hands...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T06:48:08-07:00","id":1299579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1297533-concept-heterodoxical-styles-featuring-cloud-mastery-style-and-golden-bells-style?p=1299497#post1299497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Waves Like Water to Water Dragon seems a difficult crossover, given that the former relies on snaking motions of long, flexible weapons and Water Dragon uses razors strapped onto hands...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> On the one hand, fair point.<br /> On the other hand, there is a certain notorious Immaculate with some very strong views about Exaltation being of or from the Dragons who is always drawn using a spear, even though he practices water style...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T09:42:11-07:00","id":1299626,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1297533-concept-heterodoxical-styles-featuring-cloud-mastery-style-and-golden-bells-style?p=1299579#post1299579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> On the one hand, fair point.<br /> On the other hand, there is a certain notorious Immaculate with some very strong views about Exaltation being of or from the Dragons who is always drawn using a spear, even though he practices water style...</div> </div> </div> </div>On the third hand, Deled doesn't seem like the type to have a conflicted, secret, heresy-loving side, and he's not the kind of character with hidden depths... ironically enough, being the past editions' Water poster boy. His water is not damp enough; some facet of him is drying it up.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Too Much Yang Major Weakness!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T20:02:46-07:00","id":1299826,"title":"","content":"As a set of five unique Styles with religious significance, it seems acceptable that the Immaculate Dragon Styles could be unique in having &quot;heterodoxical&quot; versions or expansions.<br /> <br /> Unless you're planning on expanding this concept beyond those five?<br /> <br /> I'm not that familiar with Weapons of the Gods.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T08:42:42-07:00","id":1299969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1297533-concept-heterodoxical-styles-featuring-cloud-mastery-style-and-golden-bells-style?p=1299497#post1299497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Waves Like Water to Water Dragon seems a difficult crossover, given that the former relies on snaking motions of long, flexible weapons and Water Dragon uses razors strapped onto hands...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd actually consider stealing from Unfolding Glory instead. Toward the end, it takes a definite hard left into &quot;Essential Water as smothering, consumptive force&quot;. which seems very in keeping with Water Dragon's bag.<br /> <br /> Channeling the reflectivity of water to pull a Face of the Moon trick would just be mean, too.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],